From ff941257efec644064d26af2109779a15f3a063a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergey Fedorov <barracuda@macos-powerpc.org>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:39:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mir: ConstPropagate keeps a raw borrow of a static a raw pointer

tree-sitter 0.27.0 binding_rust/lib.rs:4065 (ast-grep 0.45.3):

    unsafe extern "C" { static mut ts_current_free: unsafe extern "C" fn(ptr: *mut c_void); }
    let f = unsafe { core::ptr::addr_of!(ts_current_free).read() };

    MIR ERROR: ts_free: Argument (0) type mismatch: input is &unsafe extern "C" fn(..),
               but expected is *const unsafe extern "C" fn(..)

ConstPropagate rewrites a shared borrow of a static into the `ItemAddr`
constant, which is typed `&T`. It didn't check `is_raw`, so
`&raw const STATIC` (what `addr_of!` expands to) lost its `*const T`
type, and DeTemporary then put the constant into the call argument.
When the callee is small enough for the MIR inliner, the argument type
is never checked, which is why direct uses and tiny `read`s passed.

Raw borrows are left as they are.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---

diff --git a/src/mir/optimise.cpp b/src/mir/optimise.cpp
index 20c4638f..ccc058b6 100644
--- a/src/mir/optimise.cpp
+++ b/src/mir/optimise.cpp
@@ -3552,7 +3552,10 @@ bool MIR_Optimise_ConstPropagate(::MIR::TypeResolve& state, ::MIR::Function& fcn
                     }
                 TU_ARMA(Borrow, se) {
                     // Shared borrows of statics can be better represented with the ItemAddr constant
-                    if( se.type == HIR::BorrowType::Shared && se.val.m_wrappers.empty() && se.val.m_root.is_Static() )
+                    // - Not a raw borrow: `ItemAddr` is a `&T`, `&raw const STATIC` is a `*const T`
+                    //   (tree-sitter 0.27.0 lib.rs:4065 `addr_of!(ts_current_free).read()` -> "Argument (0) type mismatch:
+                    //   input is &unsafe extern "C" fn(..), but expected is *const unsafe extern "C" fn(..)")
+                    if( se.type == HIR::BorrowType::Shared && !se.is_raw && se.val.m_wrappers.empty() && se.val.m_root.is_Static() )
                     {
                         e->src = ::MIR::RValue::make_Constant( ::MIR::Constant::make_ItemAddr({ box$(se.val.m_root.as_Static()) }) );
                         changed = true;
